      <h2>Technical details, <em class="grad">at a glance.</em></h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Check deployment options, supported media formats and storage requirements before setting up Foldergram on your own hardware.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="sheet framed rv">
      <b class="mk mk-tl"></b><b class="mk mk-tr"></b><b class="mk mk-bl"></b><b class="mk mk-br"></b>
      <div class="sheet-head">
        <span class="mono">FOLDERGRAM · TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS</span>
        <svg width="120" height="24" viewBox="0 0 120 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="0" width="3" height="24"/><rect x="6" width="2" height="24"/><rect x="10" width="5" height="24"/><rect x="18" width="2" height="24"/><rect x="22" width="3" height="24"/><rect x="27" width="6" height="24"/><rect x="36" width="2" height="24"/><rect x="40" width="3" height="24"/><rect x="46" width="5" height="24"/><rect x="53" width="2" height="24"/><rect x="57" width="4" height="24"/><rect x="63" width="2" height="24"/><rect x="67" width="3" height="24"/><rect x="72" width="6" height="24"/><rect x="80" width="2" height="24"/><rect x="84" width="3" height="24"/><rect x="90" width="5" height="24"/><rect x="97" width="2" height="24"/><rect x="101" width="3" height="24"/><rect x="107" width="6" height="24"/><rect x="116" width="4" height="24"/></svg>
      </div>
      <dl>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>License</dt><dd><b>AGPL-3.0</b> · Free and open source</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Installation</dt><dd>Docker Compose (recommended) or Node.js 22 source installation</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Container images</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/foldergram/foldergram/pkgs/container/foldergram" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Container Registry</a> · <a href="https://hub.docker.com/r/sajjadalis/foldergram" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Docker Hub</a></dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Docker architectures</dt><dd>Linux AMD64 (x86-64) · Linux ARM64</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Default port</dt><dd><code>4141</code> · Configurable host port</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Media sources</dt><dd>Local folders, mounted NAS and external drives; optional read-only Immich integration</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Storage</dt><dd>Local originals stay in place; thumbnails, previews and streaming cache stored separately</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Database</dt><dd>Built-in SQLite · No separate database server required</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Image formats</dt><dd>JPEG · PNG · WebP · GIF · AVIF<br><small>Experimental opt-in support for local still HEIC / HEIF</small></dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Video formats</dt><dd>MP4 · MOV · M4V · WebM · MKV</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Video playback</dt><dd>Direct playback or on-demand streaming for new local videos by default; optional MP4 previews</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Media processing</dt><dd>FFmpeg and FFprobe included in the Docker image</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Access</dt><dd>Optional admin and viewer passwords, public browsing and scoped folder shares</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Cloud services</dt><dd>None required for local galleries</dd></div>
        <div class="srow2"><dt>Languages</dt><dd>English · German · Spanish · Chinese</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
